title: "GPUMD-MDI: MDI (MolSSI Driver Interface) integration for GPUMD"
abstract: >-
  MDI interface allowing GPUMD to run as an MDI ENGINE coupled to external
  codes such as VASP. Maintained separately from the main GPUMD repository.
